  "ruleText": "Geo 403.02 Continuing Education Requirements for New Licensees. New licensees shall obtain 12 continuing education hours for their first biennial renewal period.\n\nSource. #7526, eff 7-1-01; ss #9439, eff 3-25-09; ss by #12152, eff 3-24-17",
